title: A commit of one file is shown, the file is opened in the editor and left with Escape (nothing typed): picture 3 must show the commit's diff again and the banner '1 file', as picture 6 does for a commit of five files; then a file is opened first and its only commit shown: the diff must come when the editor is left (the log says so)
